
grep word filename  --> to serach word in file


grep -n word filename  --> to print line numbers


grep -i word filename  --> to search word in file with case sensitive


grep -v word filename  --> to print lines which don't have word


grep -c word filename  --> to count of times word appeared


grep -ic word filename   --> to count no of times a word appeared


grep -in -e word1 -e word2 -e word3 filename  --> to search multiple words


grep -in word file1 file2  --> to search in multiple files


grep -in -e word1 -e word2 -e word3 file1 file2  --> to search multiple words in multiple files
